OL,3,GNEWSATwo teens critically injured in
OL,4,Alinked stabbings
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo teenagers have been critically
OL,7,Finjured in stabbings in east London
OL,8,Fthat police are treating as linked.
OL,10,FOfficers were called at about 18:10 BST
OL,11,Fon Friday to Terrace Walk in Dagenham,
OL,12,Fwhere a 19-year-old man was found with
OL,13,Fstab injuries and taken to hospital.
OL,15,FMinutes later, a 17-year-old boy was
OL,16,Ffound with stab wounds in nearby
OL,17,FFanshawe Crescent and was also taken to
OL,18,Fhospital, where both teenagers remain.
OL,23,APub: 10-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
