OL,3,GNEWSATwo teens critically injured in
OL,4,Alinked stabbings
OL,5,
OL,6,FThey have been arrested on suspicion of
OL,7,Faffray and possession of an offensive
OL,8,Fweapon, the Metropolitan Police said.
OL,9,FIts inquiries are ongoing and anyone
OL,10,Fwith information is being urged to come
OL,11,Fforward.
